usage: orze [-h] [-V] [-c CONFIG_FILE] [--gpus GPUS] [--timeout TIMEOUT]
            [--poll POLL] [--once] [--stop] [--restart]
            [--request-id CONTROLLER_REQUEST_ID] [--disable] [--enable]
            [--report-only] [--role-only NAME] [--research-only]
            [--ideas-md IDEAS_MD] [--base-config BASE_CONFIG]
            [--results-dir RESULTS_DIR] [--train-script TRAIN_SCRIPT]
            [--init [PATH]] [--admin] [--no-admin] [--upgrade] [--reinstall]
            [--reinstall-orze-version VER] [--reinstall-pro-version VER]
            [--reinstall-extra-index-url URL] [--no-restart] [--check]
            [--launch-status] [--uninstall] [-v]
            {stop,resume,retry-eval,replicate,run-idea,gpu-lease-run,start,restart,service,reset,result,pro,sop,rebuild-state,catalog,ingest-champion,rebuild-lake,manual-notify,hf-discover,admin,ideas,init,upgrade}
            ...

orze: GPU experiment orchestrator

positional arguments:
  {stop,resume,retry-eval,replicate,run-idea,gpu-lease-run,start,restart,service,reset,result,pro,sop,rebuild-state,catalog,ingest-champion,rebuild-lake,manual-notify,hf-discover,admin,ideas,init,upgrade}
    stop                Request cooperative stop; closure remains unconfirmed
                        (75)
    resume              Re-admit one interrupted trainer checkpoint
    retry-eval          Admit one failed evaluation for retry without
                        retraining
    replicate           Explicitly admit a same-configuration repeat task
    run-idea            Run one exact queued idea on one physical GPU
    gpu-lease-run       Run an external command under exclusive physical-GPU
                        leases
    start               Start orze as a background daemon
    restart             Request stop; v2 permits source-qualified one-shot
                        handoff
    service             Manage orze watchdog service
    reset               Reset idea lake: purge failed/stale ideas for a fresh
                        start
    result              Register external experiment results so
                        professor/research agents see them
    pro                 Manage orze-pro license
    sop                 Inspect SOP skills
    rebuild-state       Rebuild best_idea_id + completions_since_best from
                        idea_lake.db
    catalog             Manage the ArtifactCatalog (ckpts / preds NPZs index)
    ingest-champion     Retroactively ingest a manual champion bundle into
                        idea_lake
    rebuild-lake        Rebuild idea_lake.db from existing results directories
    manual-notify       Send a manual status notification report
    hf-discover         Query the HuggingFace Hub for models matching criteria
    admin               Administrative utilities
    ideas               Manage rows in idea_lake.db
    init                Initialize a new orze project
    upgrade             Request upgrade; package changes and restart await
                        confirmed stop (75)

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  -V, --version         show program's version number and exit
  -c CONFIG_FILE, --config-file CONFIG_FILE
                        Path to orze.yaml project config
  --gpus GPUS           Comma-separated GPU IDs (default: auto-detect)
  --timeout TIMEOUT     Max training time in seconds
  --poll POLL           Seconds between iterations
  --once                Run one cycle and exit
  --stop                Request cooperative stop; unconfirmed closure returns
                        75
  --restart             Request stop; v2 one-shot handoff requires --request-
                        id
  --request-id CONTROLLER_REQUEST_ID
                        Stable one-shot controller restart key (not a
                        replication key)
  --disable             Stop and persistently disable Orze (survives restarts)
  --enable              Check enable admission; pending stop markers are
                        preserved
  --report-only         Only regenerate report
  --role-only NAME      Run a single agent role once and exit
  --research-only       Alias for --role-only research
  --ideas-md IDEAS_MD   Path to ideas markdown file
  --base-config BASE_CONFIG
                        Path to base config YAML
  --results-dir RESULTS_DIR
                        Directory for results
  --train-script TRAIN_SCRIPT
                        Training script to run per idea
  --init [PATH]         (deprecated — use 'orze init [path]') Initialize a new
                        project
  --admin               Launch admin panel instead of farm loop
  --no-admin            Do not start the background admin panel
  --upgrade             Request upgrade; installation requires confirmed stop
                        (75)
  --reinstall           Request reinstall; confirmed stop is required before
                        package changes or restart (75 while unconfirmed)
  --reinstall-orze-version VER
                        Pin orze version for --reinstall
  --reinstall-pro-version VER
                        Pin orze-pro version for --reinstall
  --reinstall-extra-index-url URL
                        Extra pip index URL for --reinstall (e.g. private
                        PyPI)
  --no-restart          Compatibility option; does not bypass confirmed-stop
                        admission
  --check               Validate config, check files, API keys, GPUs, .env —
                        then exit
  --launch-status       Report stop/pause launch policy as JSON without GPU
                        access, then exit
  --uninstall           Full uninstall: stop orze, remove runtime files, pip
                        uninstall — keeps only research results
  -v, --verbose         Debug logging

Examples:
  python -m orze.cli                             # all GPUs, continuous
  python -m orze.cli -c orze.yaml --gpus 0,1     # with project config
  python -m orze.cli --once                      # one cycle then exit
  python -m orze.cli --report-only               # regenerate report
        
HELP_ISOLATION={"core_help_exit": 0, "forbidden_events": [], "guard_replaces_no_product_function": true, "pro_imported": false}
